    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3788cefc2ccf90485028f475",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这篇报导在内文中，\n还配上东瀛佐敦在“皋月赏”前练跑时，\n浑身泥泞的照片。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a1c22db7019c56013e898dc03ce5268664c528569ecc47f18e0ea63b3f4ea1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bafbbb55342cc03c76ee43f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在为治疗脚趾甲烦恼的同时，为了实现梦想，\n经过不断训练后，全力跑完了“皋月赏”，\n却在赛后紧急送医，震惊观众──",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf214e82cb48845c5c9710cbea5927dc31d7a29bc8e79dcccb596988c83284e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7668a59a0e6d19d83208f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──就医回来之后，从她的笑容\n可以看出她下了某种决心。\n今后她一定能跑出亮眼的比赛吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2200c66f56b2632155d6c4eb9553d45ac93f56c18103b88f27f9615f0673aed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5061a8048cffc50e89f1b26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这篇纯粹为东瀛佐敦打气的报导底端……\n写着在皋月赏之前，\n曾来采访的那位记者的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44eb16800928533f464709afac9efe746ec5ed9dc60d730169c2008780c827a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
