      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我之前听说过很多你的流言蜚语。\n像是你常常翘掉选拔赛，\n或是你不可能赢得三冠之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa5d6266420707eb558ce7fe42fa40a595a0581da96487d693455bf8a47058d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
